{"unit_id":"vidgewong__dsh-omniloop#feature-1","repo":"vidgewong/dsh-omniloop","commit":"c1bca703c7756746dc6d1c1e11ddcd14bc90d685","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-omniloop 的功能「按会话选择引擎」：新会话可使用内置 loop、Claude Code、Codex 或 Pi；网页 composer 的选择器为会话预留所选引擎，并打开新会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/LoopEngineComposerSelect.tsx:199"]}
